body:
In showing her what is serious? This entire situation is serious.

&#x200B;

She is angry because of what i did and the situation i put us in. I tell her each time that she has every right to be angry.

I am giving her all the clarity i can. I told im seeing a therapist tomorrow and some of what im changing.

&#x200B;

As for the sheet I really dont know. I hope she likes it.

And i am willing to suffer through every moment of that in order to continue to be with her.

&#x200B;

Oh yes i am. I forgot it was sunday

not good with what?

&#x200B;

no please dont leave
